          "type": "mc",
          "difficulty": "medium",
          "stem": "Solve the trigonometric equation for $$0^{\\\\circ} \\\\le x \\\\le 360^{\\\\circ}$$: <br> $$ \\\\sin^2 x = \\\\frac{3}{4} $$",
          "options": [
            "\\(x = 30^{\\circ}, 150^{\\circ}, 210^{\\circ}, 330^{\\circ}\\)",
            "\\(x = 60^{\\circ}, 120^{\\circ}, 240^{\\circ}, 300^{\\circ}\\)",
